WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.705
ANY and ALL can be summarized with a simple contrast
ANY needs at

00:00:05.718 --> 00:00:11.664
least one successful comparison ALL needs every
comparison to succeed

00:00:13.387 --> 00:00:19.149
Equality with ANY behaves much like IN These are
useful intuitions

00:00:19.426 --> 00:00:24.123
but always remember that NULL values and empty sets
can affect the formal SQL logic
